  "description": "Seokjoo moves in with Seungho, a friend his childhood crush. Very outgoing and popular in his youth, Seungho became withdrawn during adulthood. How will Seokjoo react when he learns that his first love is inviting strangers to the apartment where they live together?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/comic/ep_list/kkamang_k/?p_id=tw091003), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/black_bean), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000061754), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=10809197), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/64150189)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[French](https://www.lezhinfr.com/detail/bt_1110502), [German](https://www.lezhinde.com/detail/dbd_10023)",
